{{!
    @template mod_presenterai/attempts

    The learner's own attempts, newest first, including attempts whose media
    is gone: those keep their row, their date and their status, and the
    actions cell says in words that the recording is no longer available.

    Every value comes from attempt_row::export, which reads the row and never
    the site settings (design section 9.1). This template reads nothing else.

    The recording state cell is never empty (design 11, rule 6). The Watch,
    Download and Delete controls carry an aria-label naming the attempt's date,
    so a screen reader user does not hear "Download, Download, Download"
    (rule 3). The download-off note appears once, below the table, and the
    table points at it with aria-describedby (rule 7).

    The Score cell shows the attempt's current score, or is empty when the
    attempt has none yet. A row with a score is followed by a row holding a
    Feedback disclosure, whose summary carries an aria-label naming the
    attempt's date for the same reason as the Watch control. Each criterion
    says what it scored out of its maximum, or that it wasn't assessed, and a
    criterion that doesn't count toward the score says so in words (D23).

    The body language section shows the gated summary or the sentence for why
    there isn't one (design 6, 9.6). It is rendered only when it has text, so
    the learner never sees an empty visual panel, and it never shows the raw
    note.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasattempts - Whether there are any rows.
    * showdownloadoffnote - Whether to render the download-off note.
    * rows - List of attempt_row::export() results, including:
      hasscore, score, hasfeedback, feedbackaria and
      feedback (criteria: list of name (HTML from format_string), scoretext,
      feedback and notcounted; overall: HTML; hastips and tips; hasvisual,
      visualstatus, visualheading, visualnote and visualtext).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasattempts": true,
        "showdownloadoffnote": true,
        "rows": [
            {
                "recid": 8,
                "attempt": "2",
                "recorded": "6/10/26, 14:00",
                "length": "6:12",
                "status": "Submitted",
                "statekey": "attempt_deletes_on",
                "state": "Deletes on 5/11/26",
                "mediaavailable": true,
                "canwatch": true,
                "watcharia": "Watch the recording you made on 6/10/26, 14:00",
                "candownload": false,
                "downloadurl": "",
                "downloadaria": "Download the recording you made on 6/10/26, 14:00",
                "candelete": true,
                "deletearia": "Delete the recording you made on 6/10/26, 14:00",
                "gonenote": "",
                "hasscore": true,
                "score": "80.00%",
                "hasfeedback": true,
                "feedbackaria": "Feedback on the attempt you made on 6/10/26, 14:00",
                "feedback": {
                    "criteria": [
                        {"name": "Content", "scoretext": "4 out of 5", "feedback": "Your thesis was clear from the start.",
                            "notcounted": false},
                        {"name": "Delivery", "scoretext": "Not assessed", "feedback": "", "notcounted": false},
                        {"name": "Body Language &amp; Gestures", "scoretext": "3 out of 5",
                            "feedback": "Your hands stayed low in four of the six frames.", "notcounted": true}
                    ],
                    "overall": "A well organized talk.<br>Slow down in the conclusion.",
                    "hastips": true,
                    "tips": ["Pause after each main point."],
                    "hasvisual": true,
                    "visualstatus": "summary",
                    "visualheading": "Body language and camera presence",
                    "visualnote": "This summary was written by the AI from six still frames taken from your recording.",
                    "visualtext": "Your hands stayed below the desk in most frames, so your gestures were hard to see."
                }
            },
            {
                "recid": 7,
                "attempt": "1",
                "recorded": "1/10/26, 09:30",
                "length": "5:48",
                "status": "Submitted",
                "statekey": "attempt_gone_learner",
                "state": "You deleted this recording on 2/10/26",
                "mediaavailable": false,
                "canwatch": false,
                "watcharia": "Watch the recording you made on 1/10/26, 09:30",
                "candownload": false,
                "downloadurl": "",
                "downloadaria": "Download the recording you made on 1/10/26, 09:30",
                "candelete": false,
                "deletearia": "Delete the recording you made on 1/10/26, 09:30",
                "gonenote": "No longer available to watch",
                "hasscore": false,
                "score": "",
                "hasfeedback": false,
                "feedbackaria": "Feedback on the attempt you made on 1/10/26, 09:30",
                "feedback": {"criteria": [], "overall": "", "hastips": false, "tips": [], "hasvisual": false,
                    "visualstatus": "", "visualheading": "", "visualnote": "", "visualtext": ""}
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<h3 class="mod-presenterai-attempts-heading mt-4">{{#str}}yourattempts, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</h3>
{{^hasattempts}}
<p class="mod-presenterai-noattempts">{{#str}}noattempts, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
{{/hasattempts}}
{{#hasattempts}}
<table class="generaltable mod-presenterai-attempts" data-region="attempts"{{#showdownloadoffnote}} aria-describedby="mod-presenterai-dlnote-{{uniqid}}"{{/showdownloadoffnote}}>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_attempt, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_recorded, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_length, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_status, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_score, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_recording, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
            <th scope="col">{{#str}}col_actions, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {{#rows}}
        <tr data-recid="{{recid}}" class="mod-presenterai-attempt{{^mediaavailable}} mod-presenterai-attempt-nomedia{{/mediaavailable}}">
            <td>{{attempt}}</td>
            <td>{{recorded}}</td>
            <td>{{length}}</td>
            <td>{{status}}</td>
            <td data-region="score">{{score}}</td>
            <td data-region="state" data-statekey="{{statekey}}" tabindex="-1">{{state}}</td>
            <td data-region="actions">
                {{#canwatch}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 mr-2" data-action="watch" data-recid="{{recid}}" aria-label="{{watcharia}}">{{#str}}watch, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
                {{/canwatch}}
                {{#candownload}}
                <a class="mr-2" href="{{downloadurl}}" data-action="download" aria-label="{{downloadaria}}">{{#str}}download, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</a>
                {{/candownload}}
                {{#candelete}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 text-danger" data-action="delete" data-recid="{{recid}}" data-recorded="{{recorded}}" aria-label="{{deletearia}}">{{#str}}delete, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
                {{/candelete}}
                {{#gonenote}}
                <span class="mod-presenterai-gone-note">{{gonenote}}</span>
                {{/gonenote}}
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{#hasfeedback}}
        <tr class="mod-presenterai-feedback-row" data-feedbackfor="{{recid}}">
            <td colspan="7">
                <details class="mod-presenterai-feedback">
                    <summary aria-label="{{feedbackaria}}">{{#str}}feedback_toggle, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</summary>
                    {{#feedback}}
                    <ul class="mod-presenterai-feedback-criteria list-unstyled mt-2">
                        {{#criteria}}
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>{{{name}}}</strong>: {{scoretext}}{{#notcounted}} <span class="badge badge-info mod-presenterai-notcounted">{{#str}}feedback_criterion_notcounted, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</span>{{/notcounted}}{{#feedback}}<br>{{feedback}}{{/feedback}}</li>
                        {{/criteria}}
                    </ul>
                    {{#hasvisual}}
                    <div class="mod-presenterai-visual-feedback mb-2" data-region="visual-feedback" data-visualstatus="{{visualstatus}}">
                        <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{visualheading}}</strong></p>
                        {{#visualnote}}
                        <p class="mod-presenterai-visual-note small mb-1">{{visualnote}}</p>
                        {{/visualnote}}
                        <p class="mod-presenterai-visual-text mb-0">{{visualtext}}</p>
                    </div>
                    {{/hasvisual}}
                    {{#overall}}
                    <p class="mod-presenterai-feedback-overall">{{{overall}}}</p>
                    {{/overall}}
                    {{#hastips}}
                    <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{#str}}feedback_tips, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</strong></p>
                    <ul class="mod-presenterai-feedback-tips">
                        {{#tips}}
                        <li>{{.}}</li>
                        {{/tips}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/hastips}}
                    {{/feedback}}
                </details>
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{/hasfeedback}}
        {{/rows}}
    </tbody>
</table>
{{#showdownloadoffnote}}
<p id="mod-presenterai-dlnote-{{uniqid}}" class="mod-presenterai-dlnote small">{{#str}}download_off_note, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
{{/showdownloadoffnote}}
{{/hasattempts}}
